# Keep default searches focused on active, human-sized project context.
docs/09_frozen/**
artifacts/**

# Machine-readable seed resources are parsed by scripts, but should not appear in broad context searches.
docs/02_architecture/test_resources/T-129_*_TEST_PROFILES.md

